<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτομερ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέρος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>composed of small particles</i>, as water and fire,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παχυμερής</span>, Ti. 
				Locr.
			<i><span class="en">
				100e
			</span></i>; of the soul, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.19U.
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έστερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				303b19
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έστατος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>de An.</u>
				405a6
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>treated in detail</i> or <i>minutely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Geog.</u>
				1.22.1
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Tz.
				<u>H.</u>
				10.159
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ρῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phot.
					<u>Bibl.</u>
					p.4
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
			<i>refined</i> or <i>meticulous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. καὶ δεδιδαγμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
					8(2).124
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
